    "title": "Inmate escapes in Opelousas while being moved from behavioral center to St. Landry Parish Jail - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By News 15 Staff ,\n5 hours ago OPELOUSAS, La. (NEWS 15) — The Opelousas Police Department is searching for an inmate who escaped custody while being transported back to jail. Authorities reported Michael Vavasseur, 34, of Opelousas, escaped on Wednesday, April 15, around 3:30 p.m. while being moved from STOA Behavioral Health to the St. Landry Parish Jail. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
